-- AI Document Intake: restore the document type registry on databases where it is empty.
--
-- Root cause (Production, 2026-10-28): public.document_type_registry had 0 rows (the 2026-10-04 backups are empty too), although the
-- seed migrations 20260925 / 20260929 / 20261009 / 20261010 / 20261011 are recorded as applied. With no document type the classifier
-- returned nothing and every upload crashed right after OCR ("Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'code')").
--
-- Configuration rows only — the 46 document types of the reviewed seed migrations (20260925, 20260929, 20261009, 20261010,
-- 20261011, 20261213) in their final form. Idempotent: a type that already exists (same code, country-wide) is left untouched, so
-- re-running it or running it on DEV changes nothing. No business record is created or changed.
-- Rollback: UPDATE public.document_type_registry SET deleted_at = now() WHERE created_at >= '<apply time>' AND country_id IS NULL;

